# P18 on GtkBackend on macOS (TEST_BACKEND=gtk4): each file dialog opens and a cancel is reported back.
# Measured 2026-10-16 from p18-macos-gtk4-final-20261016-013317.png (1440x1096 = 720x548 pt; 2x halved; origin=frame with the 28 pt title bar). The AppKit file's Open a file click at y 243 fell below the button (frame y 204-238) on GTK's layout (gtk4-aim-20261016.csv2); folder and save landed near their edges and are re-centred.
# Escape cancelled the folder and save dialogs on the same run so the key rows are unchanged.
# After this file all three lines must read cancelled (open -> cancelled; folder -> cancelled; save -> cancelled).
# GTK 版 P18:Open a file 在 frame y 204-238,改點 (88,221);另兩顆按鈕重新置中。三行都必須是 cancelled。
